WEBVTT

00:00:04.220 --> 00:00:06.520
Ah, that's nice.

00:00:07.280 --> 00:00:09.000
Part your legs a little.

00:00:11.260 --> 00:00:12.450
That's it!

00:00:14.260 --> 00:00:16.570
Now, try pouting your chest out a bit.

00:00:16.570 --> 00:00:17.740
Manaka.

00:00:19.380 --> 00:00:24.900
Elementary students shouldn't be saying something like "Pout your chest out."

00:00:26.100 --> 00:00:27.320
That expression!

00:00:27.320 --> 00:00:29.260
It suits you perfectly!

00:02:09.510 --> 00:02:12.230
This bashful pose is just so...

00:02:14.200 --> 00:02:17.250
This is bound to increase your popularity dramatically!

00:02:20.580 --> 00:02:24.660
Becoming popular like this doesn't make me happy.

00:02:25.240 --> 00:02:27.240
What are you talking about?

00:02:27.240 --> 00:02:33.280
This isn't about Akemiya Masaki; it's for the homepage of Yamasaki Akemi, the model.

00:02:33.930 --> 00:02:36.990
We need to provide more fanservice
to get our hit counter up!

00:02:38.480 --> 00:02:41.660
I don't really care...

00:02:42.640 --> 00:02:45.280
Are you still saying things like that?!

00:02:46.130 --> 00:02:47.640
M-Manaka?

00:02:48.970 --> 00:02:53.400
Really, Onii-chan — even though
you're a boy, you lack guts.

00:02:58.920 --> 00:03:02.660
As cute as you are, wouldn't it be such a waste?

00:03:02.940 --> 00:03:03.580
Mana!

00:03:03.580 --> 00:03:05.950
You have such fair, smooth skin.

00:03:07.570 --> 00:03:11.690
You really do look like a girl,
even without make-up.

00:03:11.980 --> 00:03:14.600
Ah, what a tantalizing scent!

00:03:14.600 --> 00:03:16.160
Stop it!

00:03:16.550 --> 00:03:19.810
"If only I were a girl in truth."

00:03:19.810 --> 00:03:21.980
That's what you're thinking, isn't it?

00:03:28.250 --> 00:03:29.210
It wouldn't work.

00:03:33.250 --> 00:03:34.740
Even if I...

00:03:36.980 --> 00:03:39.590
...were really a girl.

00:03:57.780 --> 00:03:59.860
What's the matter, Sumi-chan?

00:03:59.860 --> 00:04:01.920
Ah, it's nothing.

00:04:06.500 --> 00:04:08.390
What's wrong with you?!

00:04:08.620 --> 00:04:10.540
How rude!

00:04:10.540 --> 00:04:13.390
How can you just throw a letter away without even reading it?

00:04:14.160 --> 00:04:18.860
Well, normally you'd throw a letter like that away without reading it.

00:04:19.410 --> 00:04:23.250
By the way, who are you?

00:04:23.600 --> 00:04:25.410
Someone's sister?

00:04:26.640 --> 00:04:27.350
I am—

00:04:31.740 --> 00:04:32.920
Huh?

00:04:40.360 --> 00:04:42.590
What are you doing here?!

00:04:43.260 --> 00:04:44.540
How mean!

00:04:44.540 --> 00:04:46.970
I came here for you!

00:04:46.970 --> 00:04:48.430
Akemiya-kun...

00:04:49.170 --> 00:04:50.430
Who is she?

00:04:50.430 --> 00:04:51.570
Murasame-san...

00:04:52.040 --> 00:04:54.620
She's my little sister, Manaka.

00:04:54.620 --> 00:04:58.010
I heard that you spurned my brother.

00:04:59.810 --> 00:05:03.950
Oh, that's right; I did turn him down.

00:05:04.160 --> 00:05:04.610
Yeah.

00:05:04.610 --> 00:05:06.240
What is your problem?

00:05:06.490 --> 00:05:09.370
You like cute girls, don't you?

00:05:09.920 --> 00:05:14.250
My brother is so cute, so why don't you like him?

00:05:18.700 --> 00:05:21.280
Hold on a second.

00:05:21.280 --> 00:05:23.920
You seem fairly confident, but I'm nevertheless certain that you're completely wrong.

00:05:23.920 --> 00:05:25.660
Well, whatever.
You seem fairly confident, but I'm nevertheless certain that you're completely wrong.

00:05:25.960 --> 00:05:29.760
Perhaps his adorable nature
is too much for you to handle.

00:05:29.980 --> 00:05:35.040
Even though we're siblings,
there are times when even I can't hold back.

00:05:37.340 --> 00:05:42.770
Um, where should I begin
to clear up this misunderstanding?

00:05:42.770 --> 00:05:44.560
That's why I'll give you one more chance.

00:05:44.560 --> 00:05:47.530
Go on a date with my brother next Sunday!

00:05:47.530 --> 00:05:49.490
Why would I do that?

00:05:49.490 --> 00:05:50.520
If you refuse,

00:05:50.520 --> 00:05:54.040
I'll expose this embarrassing picture of my brother to the entire world!

00:05:54.040 --> 00:05:56.290
Like I care, fool!

00:05:56.570 --> 00:05:57.680
Are you sure?

00:05:57.680 --> 00:06:00.790
It'll be your fault if something
terrible happens to him!

00:06:01.090 --> 00:06:05.010
All the perverts and creeps across the world will descend upon him—

00:06:05.980 --> 00:06:07.200
Will you stop it?

00:06:07.560 --> 00:06:09.680
You're bothering Murasame-san.

00:06:10.360 --> 00:06:15.820
I put up with your nonsense because we're siblings,
but don't cause any trouble—

00:06:18.920 --> 00:06:20.220
I...

00:06:20.750 --> 00:06:28.510
I was just worried about you
and wanted to do what I could to help!

00:06:29.880 --> 00:06:35.790
You even have a picture of her
hidden in your wallet—

00:06:35.790 --> 00:06:37.750
Okay! Okay, I get it!

00:06:47.120 --> 00:06:49.390
Fine, I'll go on a date with him.

00:06:50.580 --> 00:06:52.530
It's just a one-time thing, though.

00:06:53.120 --> 00:06:54.600
Murasame-san.

00:06:55.090 --> 00:06:59.650
I know what it's like to have
failures for brothers.

00:06:59.890 --> 00:07:01.000
Huh...

00:07:01.480 --> 00:07:03.020
Is that so?

00:07:03.830 --> 00:07:06.030
Just as planned!

00:07:28.760 --> 00:07:31.510
This has taken an unexpected turn.

00:07:35.380 --> 00:07:40.890
Come to think of it, this is the first time I've gone on a date with a boy.

00:07:45.560 --> 00:07:47.330
Murasame-san!

00:07:53.170 --> 00:07:55.420
I'm sorry; did I make you wait?

00:07:57.180 --> 00:08:00.620
Oh, Akemiya-kun.

00:08:00.620 --> 00:08:03.350
It took me a while to do my hair.

00:08:03.350 --> 00:08:05.650
Oh, I see.

00:08:07.740 --> 00:08:10.520
It's convenient when you
want to change your image.

00:08:10.520 --> 00:08:12.550
Would you like to try it, Murasame-san?

00:08:13.490 --> 00:08:15.970
No, it's not really my thing.

00:08:16.520 --> 00:08:18.960
Wait! Why are you dressed up as a girl?!

00:08:20.610 --> 00:08:24.200
I thought this would be better for you.

00:08:24.750 --> 00:08:26.350
Really?

00:08:26.610 --> 00:08:27.980
You did this for me?

00:08:28.630 --> 00:08:32.640
Isn't it actually because you enjoy cross-dressing?

00:08:35.320 --> 00:08:37.200
Of course not...

00:08:39.450 --> 00:08:41.450
Well, whatever.

00:08:41.450 --> 00:08:45.770
I guess it's better than having some strange rumor about the two of us spreading.

00:08:48.010 --> 00:08:49.920
I'm sorry.

00:08:51.460 --> 00:08:53.210
Don't worry about it.

00:08:53.210 --> 00:08:54.280
Let's go.

00:08:59.690 --> 00:09:00.870
And so it begins.

00:09:00.870 --> 00:09:02.680
Murasame Sumika!

00:09:02.680 --> 00:09:07.260
Those dim glasses of yours will clear before the alluring charms of my brother!

00:09:08.610 --> 00:09:11.840
First, they'll get in the mood
with the movie I chose.

00:09:11.840 --> 00:09:15.370
Then, they'll emerge from the theater onto the glimmering street outside.

00:09:15.720 --> 00:09:20.140
There, she'll be swept away by the dazzling light that is the charm of the moment!

00:09:21.740 --> 00:09:23.720
That was a good movie.

00:09:23.720 --> 00:09:24.860
Yes.

00:09:31.250 --> 00:09:33.260
I cried a little.

00:09:40.070 --> 00:09:43.960
So this is what your sister recommended?

00:09:44.770 --> 00:09:45.940
Yes.

00:09:46.420 --> 00:09:47.850
R-15?

00:09:49.290 --> 00:09:52.070
I hate horror movies!

00:09:52.620 --> 00:09:54.690
Let's watch that.

00:09:55.080 --> 00:09:58.250
But I've already bought pre-sale tickets...

00:10:00.330 --> 00:10:01.300
Your feature presentation will begin shortly.

00:10:01.300 --> 00:10:03.720
Nice of them to trade tickets with us.

00:10:03.720 --> 00:10:04.660
Your feature presentation will begin shortly.

00:10:05.720 --> 00:10:06.000
I guess.

00:10:06.000 --> 00:10:10.500
Patrons in the lobby, please return to your seats.

00:10:11.610 --> 00:10:14.640
Out of consideration for your fellow patrons,

00:10:14.640 --> 00:10:18.610
please turn off your cellphones
for the duration of the movie.

00:10:36.770 --> 00:10:38.100
Ah, Sumi-chan?

00:10:38.100 --> 00:10:44.950
The number you have dialed is either out of the service area, or the phone has been switched off.

00:10:57.780 --> 00:11:00.020
That was amazingly dull.

00:11:02.010 --> 00:11:04.390
I think I dozed off for a bit.

00:11:04.920 --> 00:11:06.830
I'm hungry.

00:11:06.830 --> 00:11:09.410
Oh, I know a good place.

00:11:10.250 --> 00:11:11.650
Next!

00:11:14.090 --> 00:11:15.650
She went out?

00:11:15.900 --> 00:11:17.030
Yes.

00:11:17.340 --> 00:11:20.880
I thought that she was with you, though.

00:11:23.980 --> 00:11:26.830
Is it something urgent?

00:11:28.680 --> 00:11:34.810
No, I just wanted to hang out with her,
since it's such a nice day.

00:11:48.280 --> 00:11:52.560
The number you have dialed is
either out of the service area—

00:11:52.560 --> 00:11:53.940
Geez...

00:11:59.410 --> 00:12:00.320
Welcome!

00:12:05.050 --> 00:12:07.660
Your sister suggested this place as well?

00:12:07.960 --> 00:12:10.440
Yes, she recommended it.

00:12:11.240 --> 00:12:15.460
Speaking of which, wasn't it because of her that you began modeling?

00:12:17.020 --> 00:12:19.200
Well, yeah.

00:12:20.760 --> 00:12:22.650
She's not a bad girl.

00:12:23.450 --> 00:12:28.740
As her brother, I'm glad that she's going to such lengths for me.

00:12:30.880 --> 00:12:31.860
It's not opening—

00:12:36.600 --> 00:12:38.400
It's all over me.

00:12:44.890 --> 00:12:47.920
You just cried out like a girl, didn't you?!

00:12:47.920 --> 00:12:51.170
But I'm supposed to be a girl right now.

00:12:51.170 --> 00:12:54.520
Really? Is that all there is to it?

00:12:57.120 --> 00:12:58.780
I'm sorry.

00:13:07.920 --> 00:13:09.450
What's wrong?

00:13:11.660 --> 00:13:13.680
I'm getting a slight headache.

00:13:18.060 --> 00:13:21.320
His charms appear to be working!

00:13:22.740 --> 00:13:27.830
Now, I just need to sprinkle this suspicious elixir I got off the internet on their food.

00:13:28.130 --> 00:13:29.830
Here, now.

00:13:34.800 --> 00:13:36.700
Children shouldn't be here.

00:13:37.520 --> 00:13:40.480
Play house at home, will you?

00:13:50.460 --> 00:13:51.900
Next!

00:14:13.490 --> 00:14:15.780
This is boring.

00:14:26.010 --> 00:14:27.630
I can't get used to this.

00:14:30.880 --> 00:14:34.130
The fashion mall is my brother's home ground.

00:14:34.380 --> 00:14:38.140
Those cute and frilly dresses
are certain to captivate her!

00:14:39.080 --> 00:14:44.340
All of the places recommended
by your sister are for girls.

00:14:46.120 --> 00:14:49.660
Doesn't it feel like she's playing with you?

00:14:51.880 --> 00:14:56.970
I heard that brothers and sisters
grow apart as they get older.

00:14:59.120 --> 00:15:06.810
Manaka is close to me right now,
but before I know it, she'll be calling me gross or annoying.

00:15:07.480 --> 00:15:11.570
I want to be as close to her
as possible before that day comes.

00:15:14.800 --> 00:15:18.440
Wearing slightly strange clothing
is a small price to pay.

00:15:20.040 --> 00:15:22.600
Yeah, my brothers and I—

00:15:22.600 --> 00:15:25.060
Oh! This is so cute!

00:15:27.050 --> 00:15:28.770
In a general sense!

00:15:30.280 --> 00:15:33.310
Yeah, isn't it just...

00:15:36.530 --> 00:15:38.490
That's so cute.

00:15:38.490 --> 00:15:41.330
I have that very dress in a different color.

00:15:41.330 --> 00:15:42.700
Would you care to try it on?

00:15:42.700 --> 00:15:44.070
Please, go right ahead.

00:15:44.070 --> 00:15:45.700
Would your friend like this one?

00:15:45.700 --> 00:15:47.840
It's a new brand.

00:15:48.980 --> 00:15:50.340
This is bad.

00:15:50.680 --> 00:15:54.440
Oh my, we appear to be out of dressing rooms.

00:15:54.440 --> 00:15:57.820
It's all right, since you're both girls.

00:15:59.040 --> 00:16:00.390
It won't open!

00:16:00.390 --> 00:16:02.350
Um...

00:16:03.010 --> 00:16:05.810
Since we're here, do you want to try it on?

00:16:05.810 --> 00:16:06.640
Why?

00:16:06.640 --> 00:16:11.990
I'm used to girls changing clothes because of work, so don't mind me.

00:16:11.990 --> 00:16:13.360
I don't want to!

00:16:14.740 --> 00:16:20.490
Speaking of which,
how do the other models treat you?

00:16:21.360 --> 00:16:24.280
As if I were their adorable pet.

00:16:25.370 --> 00:16:28.380
They don't treat me in any special way.

00:16:32.480 --> 00:16:34.640
Hey! You're actually going to change?!

00:16:35.090 --> 00:16:37.370
Wait, Murasame-san...

00:16:38.040 --> 00:16:42.660
If you stare at me like that, I...

00:16:48.900 --> 00:16:50.640
Don't act so coquettish!

00:16:50.640 --> 00:16:53.150
I'm not doing it on purpose!

00:17:02.370 --> 00:17:04.040
Are you finished?

00:17:04.420 --> 00:17:07.180
Ah, you look stunning!

00:17:07.180 --> 00:17:09.780
What about your friend?

00:17:10.280 --> 00:17:12.050
Um, I...

00:17:12.270 --> 00:17:14.850
Oh, the size.

00:17:17.500 --> 00:17:20.040
Would you like to try on some bottoms too?

00:17:20.040 --> 00:17:23.380
These two are in right now.

00:17:24.200 --> 00:17:25.800
They might be a little too flamboyant.

00:17:25.800 --> 00:17:28.060
Are you concerned about the colors?

00:17:28.450 --> 00:17:30.040
Then, how about this?

00:17:30.040 --> 00:17:32.310
The fabric is truly exceptional.

00:17:32.620 --> 00:17:34.540
Oh, it really is!

00:17:35.120 --> 00:17:37.590
Damn it; it's just too awkward!

00:17:37.590 --> 00:17:38.570
Murasame-san?

00:17:38.860 --> 00:17:40.710
A sudden plot twist?!

00:17:40.710 --> 00:17:44.080
It can't be helped;
I must resort to my ultimate weapon!

00:17:47.330 --> 00:17:49.460
You're such a jerk, God!

00:17:49.460 --> 00:17:56.590
If you have the time to make a boy that cute,
then why can't you do something about me?!

00:18:04.170 --> 00:18:05.360
I'm sorry.

00:18:11.170 --> 00:18:13.470
C-Can I help you?

00:18:13.870 --> 00:18:15.310
Cute...

00:18:15.310 --> 00:18:16.990
So cute...

00:18:17.370 --> 00:18:19.400
She's petrified!

00:18:19.400 --> 00:18:20.720
Now, go!

00:18:20.720 --> 00:18:24.540
The biological weapon of Akihabara — the Repulsive Trio!

00:18:24.540 --> 00:18:28.000
Your reward will be a raw action shot of an elementary school girl!

00:18:29.110 --> 00:18:30.500
Um...

00:18:30.850 --> 00:18:32.350
So cute...

00:18:33.030 --> 00:18:34.700
So cute!

00:18:36.340 --> 00:18:38.260
Glasses-girl!

00:18:38.420 --> 00:18:39.910
There it is!

00:18:39.910 --> 00:18:42.260
Mr. Gaina is really weak to her type!

00:18:43.180 --> 00:18:44.540
Don't, Mr. Gaina!

00:18:44.540 --> 00:18:45.810
You mustn't touch a 3-D girl!

00:18:45.810 --> 00:18:48.100
I'm going to take her home!

00:18:53.660 --> 00:18:55.400
Mr. Gaina!

00:18:57.210 --> 00:18:59.400
That was a good kick.

00:18:59.430 --> 00:19:01.930
I like you, Ojou-san.

00:19:02.330 --> 00:19:04.160
In that case, we will show you...

00:19:04.160 --> 00:19:05.610
...our combined power.

00:19:05.610 --> 00:19:07.540
Jet stream!

00:19:14.980 --> 00:19:16.920
Use me as your footstool!

00:19:18.700 --> 00:19:19.880
Murasame-san!

00:19:22.080 --> 00:19:22.890
So good!

00:19:23.210 --> 00:19:28.120
This is the decisive scene where the hero saves the damsel in distress!

00:19:28.120 --> 00:19:31.380
Furthermore, these aren't thugs,
but camera maniacs!

00:19:32.180 --> 00:19:34.200
Finally, it's my turn!

00:19:34.200 --> 00:19:35.270
Here I go!

00:19:36.060 --> 00:19:36.880
You!

00:19:36.880 --> 00:19:38.270
Um...

00:19:40.680 --> 00:19:42.770
Instead of that violent girl...

00:19:47.880 --> 00:19:51.580
Don't worry; I'll be back soon.

00:19:59.280 --> 00:20:00.800
Having said that...

00:20:04.180 --> 00:20:06.810
...I'm not actually a girl!

00:20:08.220 --> 00:20:10.240
I'm sorry!

00:20:14.610 --> 00:20:15.580
Huh?

00:20:15.920 --> 00:20:17.570
So what?

00:20:19.200 --> 00:20:22.450
It's inconceivable for someone
this cute not to be a girl!

00:20:22.450 --> 00:20:25.530
My blood is on fire!

00:20:25.530 --> 00:20:27.270
Breasts are mere ornaments.

00:20:27.270 --> 00:20:29.780
Normal people just don't understand.

00:20:30.760 --> 00:20:34.250
No! Stop it!

00:20:34.250 --> 00:20:35.680
Wait!

00:20:38.890 --> 00:20:40.120
Well?

00:20:40.120 --> 00:20:45.220
You were saved by my brother's alluring charms!
Have you fallen for him?

00:20:46.290 --> 00:20:49.370
Will he be fine on his own?

00:20:57.860 --> 00:21:00.660
Wait for me, Onii-chan!

00:21:00.930 --> 00:21:03.680
I'm sorry!

00:21:13.120 --> 00:21:15.750
Don't do something like that again.

00:21:17.360 --> 00:21:18.250
I won't!

00:21:21.160 --> 00:21:25.280
Just think about what could've happened if Murasame-san didn't know karate.

00:21:26.460 --> 00:21:30.460
I don't think that violent girl suits you, Onii-chan.

00:21:34.830 --> 00:21:36.890
Don't get mad...

00:23:09.960 --> 00:23:12.760
What a way to waste a Sunday.

00:23:15.420 --> 00:23:20.060
Besides, going on a date with someone other than Kazama isn't very enjoyable.

00:23:24.420 --> 00:23:25.960
Kazama!

00:23:25.960 --> 00:23:27.900
I'm so sorry!

00:23:36.930 --> 00:23:38.050
Ta-da!

00:23:38.050 --> 00:23:39.770
It's my turn now!

00:23:39.770 --> 00:23:40.890
What's wrong, Murasame-san?

00:23:40.890 --> 00:23:43.680
Oh, nothing. I was just running.

00:23:43.680 --> 00:23:47.880
From next week on, this tale of love between girls will ascend to a new plane!

00:23:47.880 --> 00:23:48.890
Kazama...

00:23:48.890 --> 00:23:50.610
I'm listening!
